 <COL N="0374D"></COL> 14.</NOTE>  missi fuerunt ad Zachariam
papam, interrogando <NOTE N="14" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0374" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0374D"></COL> interrogandum 15.</NOTE>  de regibus in Francia <NOTE N="15" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0374" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0374D"></COL> in franciam.
Amen.  <HI REND="ITALIC">his verbis desinit codex</HI>  14; 14 b.  <HI REND="ITALIC">vero ita:</HI>  
regibus instantiam. Amen.</NOTE> ,
qui illis temporibus <NOTE N="16" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0374" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0374D"></COL> qui in francia illis
