auctoritatem ergo a 7. (8.) 9.</NOTE>  iussit
Pippinum regem fieri.</P></DIV2> <DIV2 COM="0374" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0374">DCCL</HEAD> <P COM="0374">Pippinus <NOTE N="20" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0374" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0374D"></COL> P. vero secundum
15.</NOTE>  secundum morem Francorum electus
est ad regem, et unctus per manum sanctae memoriae
Bonefacii <NOTE N="21" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0374" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0374D"></COL> bonifacii 1. 9. manus sancti bonifacii 15.</NOTE>  archiepiscopi, et elevatus a Francis
in regno <NOTE N="22" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0374" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0374D"></COL> regno suo 7.</NOTE>  in <NOTE N="23" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0374" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0374D"></COL> in  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  15.</NOTE>  Suessionis <NOTE N="24" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0374" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0374D"></COL> swessionis 1.</NOTE>  civitate. Hildericus
vero, qui false <NOTE N="25" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0374" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0374D"></COL> falso 15.</NOTE>  rex vocabatur, tonsoratus <NOTE N="26" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0374" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0374D"></COL> tonsuratus 1.</NOTE>  
est, et in <NOTE N="*" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0374" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0374B"></COL> [in Sithiu monasterium missus. Pippinus, monente
sancto Bonifacio, quibusdam episcopatibus vel
medietates vel tertias rerum. . . . . <NOTE N="27" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0374" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0374D"></COL> reddidit?</NOTE>  promittens
 <COL N="0374C"></COL> in postmodum omnia restituere 9.]</NOTE>  monasterium missus.</P></DIV2> <DIV2 COM="0374" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0374">DCCLI. DCCLII.
DCCLIII.</HEAD> <P COM="0374">Pippinus rex in Saxonia <NOTE N="28" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0374" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0374D"></COL> saxoniam
1. 7. 7 b. (8.) 12.</NOTE>  iter fecit, et Hildegarius
episcopus <NOTE N="29" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0374" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0374D"></COL> episcopus Coloniensis
( <HI REND="ITALIC">ex glossa</HI> ) 1.</NOTE>  occisus est a Saxonibus in castro
 <COL N="0375A"></COL> quod dicitur Iuberg <NOTE N="1" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0375" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0375C"></COL> viberg 1. 7. (8?) 9 b. vigberg 7 b. 12. luberg
 <HI REND="ITALIC">exscriptoris vitio loco</HI>  iuberg 9. qui dicitur iuburgo
15.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="a" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0375" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0375D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Iburg</HI>  in principatu Osnabrugensi.</NOTE> , et tamen Pippinus rex victor
extitit, et pervenit usque ad locum, qui dicitur
Kimie <NOTE N="2" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0375" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0375C"></COL> dicitur . . . . Et dum 1. rime 7.</NOTE> . Et dum <NOTE N="3" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0375" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0375C"></COL> et cum 15.</NOTE>  reversus est de ipso itinere,
nuntiatum est ei <NOTE N="4" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0375" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0375C"></COL> ei  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1.</NOTE> , quod Grifo, qui in Wasconiam
fugatus est <NOTE N="5" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0375" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0375C"></COL> fugit 1. 7. (8.) 9. fugerat 9 b.</NOTE> , germanus eius occisus fuisset <NOTE N="6" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0375" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0375C"></COL> fuisset.
 <COL N="0375D"></COL> Igitur eodem 15.</NOTE> .
Eodemque anno Stephanus papa venit in Franciam,
adiutorium et solacium <NOTE N="7" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0375" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0375D"></COL> solatium 1. 7.</NOTE>  quaerendo <NOTE N="8" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0375" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0375D"></COL> quaerens
15.</NOTE>  pro iustitiis
sancti Petri; similiter et Carlomannus, monachus
et germanus supradicti Pippini regis, per iussionem
abbatis sui <NOTE N="9" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0375" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0375D"></COL> sui  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1.</NOTE>  in <NOTE N="10" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0375" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0375D"></COL> in  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5.</NOTE>  Franciam venit, quasi ad conturbandam
petitionem apostolicam [Hoc <NOTE N="11" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0375" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0375D"></COL> Hoc anno etc.
 <HI REND="ITALIC">legitur in uno codice</HI>  5.</NOTE>  anno natalem
Domini in Theodone villa, pascha in Carisiaco
celebravit.]</P></DIV2> <DIV2 COM="0375" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0375">DCCLIV.</HEAD> <COL N="0375B"></COL> <P COM="0375">Supradictus <NOTE N="12" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0375" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0375D"></COL> S. autem a. 15.</NOTE>  apostolicus Stephanus confirmavit
