coniunxit 1.</NOTE>  duos filios eius <NOTE N="14" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0375" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0375D"></COL> eius  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1.</NOTE> , domnum Carolum, et
Carlomannum in regibus, <NOTE N="15" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0375" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0375D"></COL> in reges. Dominus
1. in reges 15.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="*" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0375" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0375B"></COL> [anno Domini 754. 6. Kal. Augusti. 9.]</NOTE>  Et domnus Bonefacius <NOTE N="16" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0375" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0375D"></COL> bonifacius 1. 15. bonifatius 5.</NOTE>  
archiepiscopus in Frisia <NOTE N="17" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0375" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0375D"></COL> fresia 15.</NOTE> , nuntians <NOTE N="18" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0375" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0375D"></COL> nuncians 1.</NOTE>  verbum
Dei <NOTE N="19" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0375" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0375D"></COL> domini 1. 7. 8. 9.</NOTE>  et praedicando <NOTE N="20" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0375" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0375D"></COL> praedicatione 1. predicans v. d. martir 15.</NOTE> , martyr Christi effectus
est.</P></DIV2> <DIV2 COM="0375" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0375">DCCLV.</HEAD> <P COM="0375">Pippinus rex <NOTE N="21" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0375" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0375D"></COL> P.
itaque rex 15.</NOTE>  per apostolicam invitationem in
Italiam iter peragens, iustitiam beati Petri apostoli
quaerendo, Haistolfus <NOTE N="22" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0375" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0375D"></COL> haistolfus 5. 7. 8. 15.</NOTE>  Langobardorum <NOTE N="23" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0375" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0375D"></COL> longobardorum
1. rex long. 15.</NOTE>  rex supradictam
iustitiam vetando <NOTE N="24" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0375" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0375D"></COL> iusticiam prohibendo
15.</NOTE>  clusas <NOTE N="25" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0375" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0375D"></COL> clausas 1. 7. 15.</NOTE>  Langobardorum
petiit, obviam Pippino regi et Francis venit <NOTE N="26" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0375" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0375D"></COL> venit. Inito igitur
bello 15.</NOTE> .
Et inierunt bellum, et Domino auxiliante,
 <COL N="0375C"></COL> beatoque Petro apostolo intercedente <NOTE N="27" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0375" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0375D"></COL> et b. Petro interc. 15.</NOTE> , Pippinus
rex cum Francis victor <NOTE N="28" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0375" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0375D"></COL> victor
cum francis 15.</NOTE>  extitit, eodemque anno <NOTE N="29" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0375" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0375D"></COL> Ipso anno 15.</NOTE>  
Stephanus papa reductus est ad sanctam sedem <NOTE N="30" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0375" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0375D"></COL> ad suam sedem
 <HI REND="ITALIC">Bouquet.</HI></NOTE>  
per missos <NOTE N="31" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0375" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0375D"></COL> per legatos d. p. r. 15.</NOTE>  domni regis Pippini, Folradum <NOTE N="32" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0375" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0375D"></COL> volradum
15.</NOTE>  et
reliquis <NOTE N="33" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0375" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0375D"></COL> reliqui 9. reliquos 1. 7.</NOTE>  qui cum eo erant. Incluso vero Haistulfo <NOTE N="34" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0375" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0375D"></COL> haistolfo 7.</NOTE>  
rege in Papia civitate, iustitiam sancti Petri pollicitus
est faciendi, unde rex Pippinus, obsides 40 receptos <NOTE N="1" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0378" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0378C"></COL> susceptos 15.</NOTE> ,
 <COL N="0378A"></COL> et cum sacramenta firmata <NOTE N="2" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0378" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0378C"></COL> sacramento 1. sacramenta firmata
haberet 7. sacramenta firmata essent 9. sacramentis
confirmatos 15.</NOTE>  reversus est
in Frantiam <NOTE N="3" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0378" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0378C"></COL> franciam 1. 7. 8. 9.</NOTE> . Carlomannus monachus <NOTE N="4" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0378" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0378C"></COL> C. autem
monachus 1. 7.</NOTE>  Vienna <NOTE N="5" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0378" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0378C"></COL> in Vienna 1.</NOTE>  
civitate remansit una cum Bertrandane <NOTE N="6" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0378" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0378C"></COL> bernnadana
1. bertrada 9. berhtrade 15.</NOTE>  reginae <NOTE N="7" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0378" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0378C"></COL> regina 1. 7. (8.) 9.</NOTE>  
infirmus, languebat <NOTE N="8" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0378" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0378C"></COL> languebatque 7. (8.) 9.</NOTE>  dies multos, et obiit <NOTE N="9" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0378" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0378C"></COL> et sic obiit in pace 7.
(8.) 9.</NOTE>  
in pace.</P></DIV2> <DIV2 COM="0378" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0378">DCCLVI <NOTE N="10" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0378" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0378C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Anni</HI>  756  <HI REND="ITALIC">et</HI>  757  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt in cod.</HI>  15.</NOTE> . </HEAD> <P COM="0378">Dum prospexisset Pippinus rex, ab Haistulfo Langobardorum
rege ea non esse vera, quod <NOTE N="11" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0378" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0378C"></COL> quae
1. 7. (8.) 9. 12.</NOTE>  antea <NOTE N="12" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0378" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0378C"></COL> ante 1.</NOTE>  
promiserat de iustitiis sancti Petri, iterum iter peragens
in Italiam, Papiam obsedit, Haistulfum inclusit,
magis magisque de iustitiis sancti Petri confirmavit <NOTE N="13" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0378" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0378C"></COL> confirmavit, instabilis
 <COL N="0378D"></COL> semper maneret 1.</NOTE> ,
ut stabiles permanerent, quod antea promiserat <NOTE N="14" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0378" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0378D"></COL> antea semper p. 7.</NOTE> ,
et insuper Ravennam cum Pentapolim <NOTE N="15" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0378" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0378D"></COL> pentapoli
1. 7. 9. 12.</NOTE>  
et omni Exarcatu <NOTE N="16" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0378" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0378D"></COL> exarchatu 1. 7. 9. 12.</NOTE>  conquisivit et sancto Petro tradidit <NOTE N="17" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0378" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0378D"></COL> reddidit
1.</NOTE> .
Et dum reversus est Pippinus rex, cupiebat
 <COL N="0378B"></COL> supradictus Haistulfus <NOTE N="18" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0378" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0378D"></COL> haistolfus 7.</NOTE>  nefandus rex <NOTE N="19" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0378" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0378D"></COL> nefandus rex h. 1.</NOTE>  mentiri quae
antea pollicitus fuerat, obsides dulgere <NOTE N="20" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0378" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0378D"></COL> obsides denegare 1.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="a" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0377" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0377D"></COL> Relinquere, deserere.</NOTE> , sacramenta
inrumpere <NOTE N="21" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0378" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0378D"></COL> irrumpere 1. 7. 9.</NOTE> . Quodam die venationem fecit, et
percussus est <NOTE N="22" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0378" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0378D"></COL> est
 <HI REND="ITALIC">iam in</HI>  5.  <HI REND="ITALIC">erasum, deest</HI>  7. 9. 12.</NOTE>  Dei iudicio, vitam finivit. <NOTE N="23" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0378" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0378D"></COL> finivit vitam 1.</NOTE>  Et quomodo
et qualiter missus est Desiderius rex in regno,
postea dicamus <NOTE N="24" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0378" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0378D"></COL> dicemus 7. (8.) 9.</NOTE>  </P></DIV2> <DIV2 COM="0378" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0378">DCCLVII.</HEAD> <P COM="0378">Misit Constantinus imperator regi Pippino cum aliis
donis organum, qui <NOTE N="25" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0378" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0378D"></COL> organum quod 1. 7. (8?) o.
quae 12.</NOTE>  in Franciam usque pervenit.
Et rex Pippinus tenuit placitum suum in Conpendio
 <NOTE N="26" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0378" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0378D"></COL> compendio 1. 7. 8. 9. 12.</NOTE>  cum Francis, ibique Tassilo venit, dux <NOTE N="27" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0378" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0378D"></COL> thessilo
dux venit 1.</NOTE>  Baioariorum,
in vasatico <NOTE N="28" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0378" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0378D"></COL> vassatico 7. 9.</NOTE>  se commendans per manus, sacramenta
 <COL N="0378C"></COL> iuravit multa et innumerabilia, reliquias <NOTE N="29" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0378" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0378D"></COL> reliquia 5. 6. reliquiis
1. 7. (8.) 9.</NOTE>  
sanctorum martyrum <NOTE N="30" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0378" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0378D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5.</NOTE>  manus inponens <NOTE N="31" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0378" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0378D"></COL> imponens 1. 7. (8).
9.</NOTE> , et fidelitatem
promisit regi Pippino et supradictis filiis eius,
domno Carolo et Carlomanno, sic ut vassus <NOTE N="32" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0378" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0378D"></COL> vasallus 1.</NOTE>  recta
mente et firma devotione per iustitiam <NOTE N="33" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0378" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0378D"></COL> iustitiam sicut vasallus 1.</NOTE> , sicut vassus <NOTE N="34" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0378" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0378D"></COL> sicut vassus  <HI REND="ITALIC">excidit in</HI>  7. (8.) 9.</NOTE>  
dominos suos <NOTE N="35" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0378" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0378D"></COL> domino suo 1.
7. (8.) 9;  <HI REND="ITALIC">iam</HI>  s  <HI REND="ITALIC">finale in</HI>  5  <HI REND="ITALIC">erasum,</HI>  dominos suos  <HI REND="ITALIC">loco</HI>  
dominis suis  <HI REND="ITALIC">non intellecto; pluralem tamen singulari
numero praeferre antecedentia suadent.</HI></NOTE>  esse deberet <NOTE N="b" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0377" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0377D"></COL> Sententia est: Tassilo Pippino et filiis fidelitatem
promisit, ita ut, quemadmodum vassus dominis
suis esse deberet, sic ipse vassus recta mente et
firma devotione per justitiam (ut justum erat) esset
in futuro.</NOTE> . Sic confirmavit
supradictus Tassilo <NOTE N="36" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0378" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0378D"></COL> thessilo 1.</NOTE>  supra corpus sanctorum
 <COL N="0379A"></COL> Dionisii <NOTE N="1" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0379" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0379C"></COL> dionisi 5.</NOTE> , Rustici et Eleutherii, nec non et sancti
Germani seu sancti Martini <NOTE N="2" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0379" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0379C"></COL> Germani et sancti Martyris 1.</NOTE> , ut omnibus diebus vitae
eius <NOTE N="3" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0379" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0379C"></COL> vitae
suae 7. (8.) 9.</NOTE>  sic conservaret, sicut sacramentis promiserat <NOTE N="4" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0379" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0379C"></COL> sacramentis constrictus p. 1. 7. (8?)</NOTE> :
sic et eius homines maiores natu, qui
erant cum co, firmaverunt, sicut dictum est,
in locis superius nominatis, quia <NOTE N="5" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0379" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0379C"></COL> quia  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1. 7. (8?) 9.</NOTE>  et in aliis multis.
Natalem <NOTE N="6" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0379" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0379C"></COL> Natalem etc.  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt in
omnibus codd. excepto</HI>  5.  <HI REND="ITALIC">et</HI>  9.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">in quo tamen ita reperitur:</HI>  
Eodem anno celebravit natalem domini in
Corbonaco et pascha. Et immutavit se numerus annorum
in 758.</NOTE>  Domini et pascha Corbonaco <NOTE N="a" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0379" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0379D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Cherbonne</HI>  ad Axonam contra Attiniacum posita,
aut  <HI REND="ITALIC">S. Marcou,</HI>  olim Corbeni nuncupatum, Vales.
Notit. Gall. p. 160.</NOTE>  celebravit.</P></DIV2> <DIV2 COM="0379" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0379">DCCLVIII.</HEAD> <P COM="0379">Pippinus rex in Saxoniam ibat <NOTE N="7" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0379" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0379C"></COL> ibi 1.</NOTE> , et firmitates Saxonum
per virtutem introivit <NOTE N="8" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0379" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0379C"></COL> civitates saxonum cum
virtute bellica introivit 15.</NOTE> , in loco qui dicitur
Sitnia <NOTE N="9" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0379" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0379C"></COL> sithma 1. situnna 7.
 <COL N="0379D"></COL> sitina 12.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="b" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0379" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0379D"></COL> desertum Senda, Sinedi, Sinidi  <HI REND="ITALIC">die Sende?</HI></NOTE> , et multae strages <NOTE N="10" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0379" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0379D"></COL> multas trages 5.</NOTE>  factae sunt in populo
Saxonum <NOTE N="11" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0379" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0379D"></COL> in populo saxonum
factae sunt. Et post haec polliciti sunt pippino se omnes
v. e. facturos et honore suo se praesentandos usque
ad equos 15.</NOTE> : et tunc polliciti sunt contra Pippinum
omnes voluntates eius faciendum <NOTE N="12" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0379" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0379D"></COL> faciendas 1.</NOTE> , et honores in
 <COL N="0379B"></COL> placito suo praesentandum <NOTE N="13" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0379" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0379D"></COL> praestandum 1.</NOTE> , usque in equos trecentos
per singulos annos. Et <NOTE N="14" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0379" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0379D"></COL> Et etc.  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  15.</NOTE>  inmutavit se numerus
annorum in</P></DIV2> <DIV2 COM="0379" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0379">DCCLIX.</HEAD> <P COM="0379">Natus est Pippino regi filius, cui supradictus rex
nomen suum inposuit <NOTE N="15" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0379" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0379D"></COL> imposuit 1. 7. 9.</NOTE> , ut Pippinus vocaretur sicut
et pater eius; qui vixit annos duos, et in tertio defunctus
est. <NOTE N="16" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0379" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0379D"></COL> defunctus
e. i. tertio 1. 7.</NOTE>  Eodem <NOTE N="17" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0379" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0379D"></COL> Eodem etc.  <HI REND="ITALIC">omnia usque ad
a.</HI>  775  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  15.</NOTE>  anno celebravit natalem Domini
in Longlare <NOTE N="18" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0379" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0379D"></COL> longlase 1.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="c" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0379" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0379D"></COL> Valesio p. 283,  <HI REND="ITALIC">Glaire</HI>  in Arduenna.</NOTE>  
et pascha in Iopila <NOTE N="19" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0379" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0379D"></COL> topila 1.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="d" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0380" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0380D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Jupille</HI>  contra Leodium et Haristallium, in dextra
Mosae ripa.</NOTE> . Et inmutavit <NOTE N="20" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0379" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0379D"></COL> mutavit
1.</NOTE>  
se numerus annorum in</P></DIV2> <DIV2 COM="0379" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0379">DCCLX.</HEAD> <P COM="0379">Tunc Pippinus rex, cernens Waipharium <NOTE N="21" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0379" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0379D"></COL> wapharium 1. waffarium 7. waifarium 7 b.
9. 12. gnaifarium 13.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ita deinceps fere semper.</HI></NOTE>  ducem
 <COL N="0379C"></COL> Aquitaniorum minime consentire iustitias ecclesiarum
partibus quae erant in Francia, consilium fecit
cum Francis, ut iter ageret <NOTE N="22" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0379" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0379D"></COL> ut
quae ageret 1.</NOTE>  supradictas iustitias
quaerendo in Aquitania. Et pervenit usque in locum,
qui dicitur Tedoad <NOTE N="23" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0379" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0379D"></COL> thedoad 1. theodoad 12. tedoat. 13.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="e" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0380" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0380D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Doué,</HI>  vicus 15000 passuum a fluvio Ligeri remotus,
in finibus Pictonum et Andium prope  <HI REND="ITALIC">Saumur.</HI>  
Vales. l. c. p. 552.</NOTE> . Et cum haec vidisset
Waipharius, misit missos suos, Adotbertum <NOTE N="24" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0379" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0379D"></COL> dotbertum 1. otbertum 8. autbertum 9. otherium
12. atbertus 13.</NOTE>  et Dadinum <NOTE N="25" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0379" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0379D"></COL> dawinum 12.</NOTE> ,
et dedit obsides Adalgarium <NOTE N="26" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0379" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0379D"></COL> ad Algarium Cetherium
1. Adalgarium et Aiterium 7. A. et Itherium
8. et Adalgarium et dedit obsides iterum regi P. 9.
A. et itherium 13.</NOTE>  et Eitherium
 <COL N="0382A"></COL> regi Pippino, ut omnia redderet <NOTE N="1" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0382" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0382C"></COL> redderet et q. 1. 7.</NOTE> , quicquid supradictus
rex quaerebat in causis ecclesiasticis. Et celebravit
natalem Domini in Carisiago <NOTE N="2" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0382" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0382C"></COL> carisiaco
7. (8.) 9. 12. 13.</NOTE>  et pascha. Et
inmutavit <NOTE N="3" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0382" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0382C"></COL> et immutatus est 7.</NOTE>  se numerus annorum in</P></DIV2> <DIV2 COM="0382" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0382">DCCLXI.</HEAD> <P COM="0382">Waipharius <NOTE N="4" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0382" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0382C"></COL> waifarius
 <HI REND="ITALIC">hic et infra</HI>  5.</NOTE>  dux Aquitaniorum, minime cogitans
de obsidibus vel de sacramentis <NOTE N="5" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0382" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0382C"></COL> vel sacramentis 1.</NOTE>  suis, quasi
in vindictam <NOTE N="6" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0382" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0382C"></COL> vindictam
suam in P. 1. v. super P. 7. 9. vindicta supra
13.</NOTE>  supra Pippinum regem exercitum
misit, qui ad Cavalonum <NOTE N="7" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0382" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0382C"></COL> calualdonum 1. cabilonum 7. cavalonnum 8.
cavallonum 9. cabilonem 12.</NOTE>  civitatem venerunt. Dum
et supranominatus rex synodum suum <NOTE N="8" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0382" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0382C"></COL> synodum suam 1.
7. (8.) 9.</NOTE>  teneret in
villa qui <NOTE N="9" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0382" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0382C"></COL> villa quae 1. 7. (8.) 9.</NOTE>  dicitur Dura <NOTE N="10" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0382" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0382C"></COL> duria 7 b.
12.</NOTE> , nuntiatum est ei,
quod Waipharius in omnibus mentitus est; iterum
rex <NOTE N="11" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0382" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0382C"></COL> tunc iterum rex 7. t. rex it. 9.</NOTE>  Pippinus illuc cum exercitu iter peragens, et
eius filius primogenitus nomine Carlus <NOTE N="12" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0382" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0382C"></COL> carolus
 <COL N="0382D"></COL> 1. 7. (8.) 9. karolus 12.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ita deinceps.</HI></NOTE>  cum eo, et
 <COL N="0382B"></COL> multa castella coepit <NOTE N="13" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0382" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0382D"></COL> cepit 1. 7.
(8.) 9. 12. 13.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ubique.</HI></NOTE> , quorum nomina sunt, Burbonnis <NOTE N="14" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0382" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0382D"></COL> burbonis 1. 13.</NOTE> , Cantela, Clarmontis <NOTE N="15" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0382" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0382D"></COL> darmoantis
1. claramontis 13.</NOTE> . Istas <NOTE N="16" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0382" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0382D"></COL> istos 1. istas 5. ista 7.
(8.) 9.</NOTE>  per pugnam
coepit, et in Alverno <NOTE N="17" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0382" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0382D"></COL> auernen 1.</NOTE>  alia multa <NOTE N="18" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0382" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0382D"></COL> multa alia 7.</NOTE>  castella
coepit per placitum, quae se subdiderunt in eius dominio,
et pervenit usque Limovicas <NOTE N="19" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0382" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0382D"></COL> lemonicas
1. lemovicas 7. (8.) 9. lemodicas 12. limodicas
13.</NOTE> , vastando
et desertando <NOTE N="20" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0382" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0382D"></COL> destruendo 1. 7.</NOTE>  supradictam provintiam propter neglegentiam <NOTE N="21" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0382" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0382D"></COL> negligentiam 1. neglegentias
7. negligentias 9.</NOTE>  
Waifarii ducis. Et celebravit natalem <NOTE N="22" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0382" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0382D"></COL> natale 1.</NOTE>  
Domini in Carisi go <NOTE N="23" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0382" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0382D"></COL> carisiaco
7. 12.</NOTE>  villa, et pascha <NOTE N="24" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0382" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0382D"></COL> domini et pascha in carisiaco villa anno
domini 762. 9.</NOTE>  similiter.
Et inmutavit se <NOTE N="25" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0382" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0382D"></COL> immutatus est n. 1.</NOTE>  numerus annorum in</P></DIV2> <DIV2 COM="0382" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0382">DCCLXII.</HEAD> <P COM="0382">Tertio in Aquitania <NOTE N="26" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0382" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0382D"></COL> aquitaniam
7. 9.</NOTE>  Pippinus rex iter faciens, et
coepit civitatem Bituricam et castrum quod dicitur <NOTE N="27" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0382" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0382D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1.</NOTE>  
Toarcis <NOTE N="28" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0382" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0382D"></COL> toaras 1. toarciis 12.</NOTE> . Et celebravit natalem Domini in
 <COL N="0382C"></COL> Gentiliaco villa <NOTE N="29" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0382" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0382D"></COL> villa similiter et p. 1.</NOTE> , et pascha similiter. Et <NOTE N="30" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0382" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0382D"></COL> Et inm. etc.  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1</NOTE>  inmutavit
se numerus annorum i</P></DIV2> <DIV2 COM="0382" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0382">DCCLXIII.</HEAD> <P COM="0382">Pippinus rex habuit placitum suum in Nivernis,
et quartum iter faciens in Aquitaniam ibique <NOTE N="31" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0382" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0382D"></COL> ibi 1. 7. (8.) 9.</NOTE>  
 <COL N="0383A"></COL> Tassilo <NOTE N="1" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0383" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0383C"></COL> thessilo  <HI REND="ITALIC">ita et deinceps</HI>  1.</NOTE>  dux Baioariorum postposuit sacramenta et
omnia quae promiserat, et per malum ingenium se
inde seduxit, omnia benefacta, quae Pippinus rex
avunculus eius ei fecit, postposuit; per ingenia fraudulenta
se subtrahendo Baioariam petiit, et nusquam
amplius faciem supradicti regis videre voluit. Rex
Pippinus iter peragendo per Aquitaniam <NOTE N="2" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0383" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0383C"></COL> aquitaniam u. ad c.
pervenit  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5.</NOTE> , usque
ad Cadurciam <NOTE N="3" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0383" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0383C"></COL> ad durcia 13.</NOTE>  pervenit, Aquitaniam vastando,
et revertendo per Limovicas <NOTE N="4" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0383" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0383C"></COL> lemovicas 7.
(8.) 9. 12. legemodicas 13.</NOTE>  in Franciam <NOTE N="5" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0383" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0383C"></COL> francia 13.</NOTE>  reversus
est. Et facta est hiemps <NOTE N="6" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0383" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0383C"></COL> hyems
1. 9. hiems 7. 12.</NOTE>  valida, et tenuit
rex <NOTE N="7" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0383" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0383C"></COL> rex  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1.</NOTE>  Pippinus natalem Domini in villa, qui <NOTE N="8" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0383" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0383C"></COL> quae 1. 7. (8.)
 <COL N="0383D"></COL> 9.</NOTE>  dicitur
Longlar <NOTE N="9" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0383" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0383D"></COL> longlaar 1. longolare 12.</NOTE> , et pascha similiter. Et inmutavit se
numerus annorum in</P></DIV2> <DIV2 COM="0383" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0383">DCCLXIV</HEAD> <COL N="0383B"></COL> <P COM="0383">Tunc Pippinus rex <NOTE N="10" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0383" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0383D"></COL> rex  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1. rex
pippinus 7. 9.</NOTE>  habuit placitum suum <NOTE N="11" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0383" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0383D"></COL> suum  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1.</NOTE>  ad
Wormatiam, et nullum iter aliud <NOTE N="12" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0383" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0383D"></COL> et nihil tunc
aliud 1. 7.</NOTE>  fecit, nisi in
Francia <NOTE N="13" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0383" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0383D"></COL> franciam 7. 9.</NOTE>  resedit, causam <NOTE N="14" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0383" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0383D"></COL> caussam 1. causamque
7. 9.</NOTE>  pertractabat inter Waifarium
et Tassilonem <NOTE N="15" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0383" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0383D"></COL> wapharium tessilonem 1.</NOTE> , et celebravit natalem Domini
in <NOTE N="16" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0383" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0383D"></COL> in
 <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1.</NOTE>  Carisiago <NOTE N="17" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0383" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0383D"></COL> carisiaco 7. 12.</NOTE>  villa, et pascha <NOTE N="18" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0383" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0383D"></COL> domini et pascha in
parisiaco villa anno domini 765. 9.</NOTE>  similiter.
Et inmutavit se numerus annorum in</P></DIV2> <DIV2 COM="0383" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0383">DCCLXV.</HEAD> <NOTE N="19" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0383" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0383D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">anni</HI>  764  <HI REND="ITALIC">et</HI>  
765  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt in</HI>  13.</NOTE> <P COM="0383">Tunc Pippinus rex <NOTE N="20" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0383" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0383D"></COL> rex p. 1. 7. 9. (8.)</NOTE>  habuit placitum <NOTE N="21" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0383" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0383D"></COL> placitum
habuit 1. 7.</NOTE>  suum <NOTE N="22" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0383" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0383D"></COL> suum  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1.</NOTE>  
ad Attiniacum, et nullum fecit aliud iter, et celebravit
natalem Domini in Aquis villa, et pascha similiter.
Et inmutavit <NOTE N="23" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0383" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0383D"></COL> Et inmutavit
etc.  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1.</NOTE>  se numerus annorum in</P></DIV2> <DIV2 COM="0383" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0383">DCCLXVI.</HEAD> <P COM="0383">Tunc Pippinus rex perrexit iter faciens in Aquitaniam;
et placitum suum habuit in Aurelianis civitate,
et restauravit Argentomo <NOTE N="24" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0383" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0383D"></COL> argentonio castrum 1. argentomum
castrum 7. (8.) 9. argentomachum castrum 12.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="a" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0383" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0383D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Argenton,</HI>  a meridie et occidente oppidi  <HI REND="ITALIC">Châteauroux.</HI></NOTE>  castro, quod antea Waifarius
destruxit. Supradictus Pippinus rex castrum
nominatum <NOTE N="25" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0383" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0383D"></COL> nominatum  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1.</NOTE>  reaedificavit, ibi <NOTE N="26" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0383" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0383D"></COL> ibique 7. 9.</NOTE>  Francos misit <NOTE N="27" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0383" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0383D"></COL> dimisit 7.</NOTE>  
Aquitaniam continendo <NOTE N="28" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0383" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0383D"></COL> convivendo 1. ad aquitaniam continendam 9.</NOTE> , similiter et in Biturigas <NOTE N="29" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0383" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0383D"></COL> biturgiis 1. bituricas 7. (8.) 9. 12. uituricas 13.</NOTE>  
Francorum <NOTE N="30" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0383" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0383D"></COL> francorum  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1.</NOTE>  scaram conlocavit. Et celebravit natalem
Domini in Salmunciagum <NOTE N="31" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0383" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0383D"></COL> salmonigo villa 1. salmongiagum
villam 7. salmoniaco 12.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="b" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0384" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0384D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Samoussy</HI>  prope Lugdunum-Clavatum.</NOTE>  villam <NOTE N="32" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0383" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0383D"></COL> villam  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  9. 12.</NOTE> , et pascha <NOTE N="1" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0386" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0386C"></COL> pascha similiter.  <HI REND="ITALIC">cetera desunt</HI>  1.</NOTE>  
 <COL N="0386A"></COL> in Gentiliaco <NOTE N="2" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0386" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0386C"></COL> gentiliaco
anno q. 767. 9.</NOTE> . Et inmutavit se numerus annorum
in</P></DIV2> <DIV2 COM="0386" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0386">DCCLXVII</HEAD> <P COM="0386">Tunc habuit domnus Pippinus rex <NOTE N="3" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0386" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0386C"></COL> rex  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1. rex pippinus 7. 9.</NOTE>  in supradicta
villa synodum magnum <NOTE N="4" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0386" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0386C"></COL> magnam 1.</NOTE>  inter Romanos et Graecos
de sancta Trinitate <NOTE N="5" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0386" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0386C"></COL> sancta ciuitate 1.</NOTE>  vel de sanctorum imaginibus,
et postea perrexit iter peragens partibus <NOTE N="6" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0386" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0386C"></COL> in partibus
1. 9.</NOTE>  Aquitaniae
per Narbonam, Tolosam coepit, Albiensem similiter
necnon et Gavuldanum <NOTE N="7" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0386" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0386C"></COL> gwaldanum 1. gavaldanum 7. gavaldanam
12. galuuldanum 13.</NOTE> ; et sanus reversus
est in patriam, et celebravit pascha in Vienna <NOTE N="8" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0386" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0386C"></COL> bienna 13.</NOTE>  
civitate. Et in eodem anno in mense Augusto iterum
perrexit <NOTE N="9" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0386" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0386C"></COL> perexit  <HI REND="ITALIC">saepius</HI>  
5.</NOTE>  partibus <NOTE N="10" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0386" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0386C"></COL> ad partes 1.</NOTE>  Aquitaniae, Bituricam usque
venit, ibi synodum fecit cum omnibus Francis solito
more in campo, et inde iter peragens, usque ad Garonnam <NOTE N="11" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0386" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0386C"></COL> usque a garonnam civitas
pervenit 13.</NOTE>  
 <COL N="0386B"></COL> pervenit, multas roccas <NOTE N="12" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0386" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0386C"></COL> rockas 1.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="b" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0385" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0385D"></COL> Rocca hodieque in Italia castellum montanum
audit, exempli gratia, Rocca del Papa in monte Albano,
et quam plurima in Apennino.</NOTE>  et speluncas
conquaesivit <NOTE N="13" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0386" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0386C"></COL> conquisivit 1. 7.
