 <COL N="0403D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">in codicibus</HI>  8. 9. 10. 11. 12.  <HI REND="ITALIC">post</HI>  similiter
facere,  <HI REND="ITALIC">utrobique minus recte. In codice</HI>  13.  <HI REND="ITALIC">omnia
huius anni post</HI>  est in Franciam  <HI REND="ITALIC">una cum annis</HI>  777.
778. 779.  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt.</HI></NOTE>  per placita eos, qui infra ipsum
