ad castra <NOTE N="20" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0403" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0403D"></COL> ad castrum 5.</NOTE> , et omnis multitudo eorum in pavore concussi
fugam arrepti <NOTE N="21" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0403" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0403D"></COL> fugam arripientes
7. fuga arrepta 5.</NOTE> , alii ab aliis se invicem <NOTE N="22" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0403" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0403D"></COL> se ab invicem 5.</NOTE>  interficiebant.
 <COL N="0403C"></COL> Qui enim retro propter pavorem aliquem <NOTE N="23" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0403" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0403D"></COL> aliquem
 <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  6.</NOTE>  
respiciebant, infigebant <NOTE N="24" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0403" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0403D"></COL> infligebant 6.</NOTE>  se lanceis eorum, qui
ante illos fugiebant <NOTE N="25" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0403" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0403D"></COL> infigebant lanceas eorum,
quos in humeris portabant in corpora antecedentium
9. propter pavorem, ab antecedentibus lanceis confodiebantur
11. fugebant 5.</NOTE>  et in humeris portabant, et alii
 <COL N="0406A"></COL> diversis ictibus inter se sunt percussi <NOTE N="1" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0406" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0406C"></COL> sunt perpessi 6. 7. 8. 9.</NOTE>  et divina ultione
indicati. Et quantum super Dei eos virtus propter
salutem <NOTE N="2" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0406" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0406C"></COL> dei v. p. s. ch. super
eos 7.</NOTE>  christianorum operata est, nullus
narrare potest; attamen quantum illi plus pavore
perterriti fuerunt, tanto magis christiani confortati
omnipotentem Deum laudaverunt, qui dignatus est
suam manifestare potentiam super servos suos.] Et
inde fugam arripientes Saxones, persecuti sunt eos
Franci, interficientes illos usque ad flumen <NOTE N="3" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0406" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0406C"></COL> usque flumen 5. fluvium 1. 7. (8.).</NOTE>  Lippiam,
castro salvato; et cum victoria reversi sunt
Franci. Et cum pervenisset domnus Carolus rex
Wormatiam, et omnes istas causas <NOTE N="4" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0406" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0406C"></COL> causas
istas 5.</NOTE>  audiens <NOTE N="5" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0406" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0406C"></COL> audisset 6.</NOTE> , coniunxit
sinodum ad eandem civitatem: et ibi placitum
publicum tenens, et consilio <NOTE N="6" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0406" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0406C"></COL> concilio 1. 7.</NOTE>  facto, cum Dei
adiutorio sub celeritate et <NOTE N="7" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0406" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0406C"></COL> celeritate
et  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  6.</NOTE>  nimia <NOTE N="8" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0406" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0406C"></COL> nimia et 1.</NOTE>  festinatione
 <COL N="0406B"></COL> Saxonum caesas <NOTE N="9" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0406" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0406C"></COL> casas 7. 9. terras
10.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="a" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0405" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0405D"></COL> Munimenta ex arboribus stratis.</NOTE>  seu <NOTE N="10" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0406" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0406C"></COL> caesas seu  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1.</NOTE>  firmitates subito introivit.
Et <NOTE N="11" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0406" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0406C"></COL> Tunc Saxones 7.
9.</NOTE>  Saxones perterriti <NOTE N="12" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0406" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0406C"></COL> saxones per terras 1.</NOTE> , omnes ad locum ubi
Lippia consurgit venientes ex omni parte, et <NOTE N="13" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0406" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0406C"></COL> et  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  7.</NOTE>  reddiderunt
patriam per wadium <NOTE N="14" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0406" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0406C"></COL> waidium
 <COL N="0406D"></COL> 1. wadimoniam 9.</NOTE>  omnes <NOTE N="15" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0406" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0406D"></COL> omnibus 1. 7. omnem
in 9.</NOTE>  manibus
eorum, et spoponderunt se esse christianos, et sub dicioni <NOTE N="16" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0406" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0406D"></COL> dicione 1. 6. 7—9. etc.</NOTE>  
domni Caroli regis et Francorum subdiderunt.
Et <NOTE N="17" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0406" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0406D"></COL> et  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1. 6.</NOTE>  tunc domnus Carolus rex una cum Francis reaedificavit <NOTE N="18" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0406" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0406D"></COL> rectificavit 1. reedifficavit 6.</NOTE>  
Aeresburgum castrum denuo <NOTE N="19" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0406" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0406D"></COL> denuo  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1.</NOTE> , et aliud <NOTE N="20" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0406" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0406D"></COL> alium 6.</NOTE>  
castrum super Lippiam, ibique venientes Saxones
una cum uxoribus et infantibus innumerabilis <NOTE N="21" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0406" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0406D"></COL> et in numerabilis 6. innumerabilibus
1.</NOTE>  
multitudo baptizati sunt <NOTE N="22" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0406" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0406D"></COL> baptizata est 6.</NOTE> , et obsides, quantos iamdictus
domnus rex eis <NOTE N="23" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0406" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0406D"></COL> eis  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1. de eis 6. ab
eis 7. 9. 10.</NOTE>  quaesivit, dederunt, et perfecta
supradicta castella et disposita <NOTE N="24" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0406" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0406D"></COL> perfectis supradictis castellis et
dispositis 1. 7. 9. (10.).</NOTE>  per Francos
scaras <NOTE N="25" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0406" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0406D"></COL> scaros 6.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="b" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0405" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0405D"></COL> Scara, nostrum  <HI REND="ITALIC">Schaar,</HI>  turma.</NOTE>  residentes et ipsa custodientes <NOTE N="26" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0406" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0406D"></COL> scaris
residentibus et ipsas custodientibus 7. (10.).</NOTE> , reversus
 <COL N="0406C"></COL> est domnus rex <NOTE N="27" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0406" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0406D"></COL> domnus
rex  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1.</NOTE>  in Franciam, et caelebravit
natalem Domini in Haristallio <NOTE N="28" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0406" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0406D"></COL> haristalho 1. aristallio 5.</NOTE> , et pascha in villa
quae dicitur Niumaga <NOTE N="29" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0406" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0406D"></COL> niomaga
1. neumaga 7.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="c" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0406" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0406D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Nimwegen.</HI></NOTE> . Et inmutavit se numerus
annorum in</P></DIV2> <DIV2 COM="0406" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0406">DCCLXXVII.</HEAD> <P COM="0406">Tunc domnus Carolus rex sinodum publicum <NOTE N="30" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0406" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0406D"></COL> publicam 1. 5.</NOTE>  habuit
ad Paderbrunnen <NOTE N="31" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0406" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0406D"></COL> apud
padesbrunnen 1.</NOTE>  prima vice; ibique <NOTE N="32" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0406" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0406D"></COL> venientes 1.</NOTE>  convenientes <NOTE N="33" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0406" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0406D"></COL> convenientesque
ibi 6.</NOTE>  
omnes Franci, et ex omni parte Saxoniae
undique <NOTE N="34" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0406" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0406D"></COL> saxoniae undique  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1.</NOTE>  Saxones convenerunt <NOTE N="35" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0406" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0406D"></COL> convenerunt
 <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1.</NOTE> , excepto quod Widochindis <NOTE N="36" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0406" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0406D"></COL> vindobundis 1. witochindis 7.
windochinus 9. widochindus 8.</NOTE>  
rebellis extitit <NOTE N="37" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0406" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0406D"></COL> rebellis restaret
1.</NOTE>  cum paucis aliis <NOTE N="38" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0406" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0406D"></COL> aliis  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1.</NOTE> : in <NOTE N="39" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0406" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0406D"></COL> et in 7. 9. 10.</NOTE>  
 <COL N="0407A"></COL> partibus Nordmanniae <NOTE N="1" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407C"></COL> nordmaniae 5. normanniae 7. 9.</NOTE>  confugium fecit una cum
sociis suis. Etiam ad eundem <NOTE N="2" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407C"></COL> ad idem
1. 7. 10.</NOTE>  placitum <NOTE N="3" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407C"></COL> placitum  <HI REND="ITALIC">hoc vocabulo incipit codex</HI>  2.</NOTE>  venerunt
Sarraceni de partibus Hispaniae <NOTE N="4" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407C"></COL> hispaniae scilicet ibinalakabe 1.</NOTE> , hii <NOTE N="5" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407C"></COL> hi 5. 7. etc.</NOTE>  sunt
Ibinalarabi et filius Deiuzefi <NOTE N="6" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407C"></COL> de vizosi 1. diuzefi 5. deiuzevi 6.</NOTE> , qui et latine Ioseph
nominatur, similiter et <NOTE N="7" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407C"></COL> similiter et 1.
5. 6. 7. 8. 9. 10. nominatur et gener eius Alaruiz
11.  <HI REND="ITALIC">vocem</HI>  alarviz  <HI REND="ITALIC">nonnisi repetitum</HI>  alarabi  <HI REND="ITALIC">esse persuasus
sum, lectionem codicis</HI>  2 simile dedit et  <HI REND="ITALIC">pro
corrupta habeo.</HI></NOTE>  gener eius, ibique multitudo
Saxonum baptizati sunt <NOTE N="8" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407C"></COL> baptizata est 1.</NOTE> , et secundum morem
illorum omnem ingenuitatem et alodem <NOTE N="9" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407C"></COL> alodum 7.
9. hereditatem 9 b.</NOTE>  manibus
dulgtum <NOTE N="10" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407C"></COL> dulgium 1. dultum 7.</NOTE>  fecerunt <NOTE N="11" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407C"></COL> fecere
1.</NOTE> , si amplius inmutassent <NOTE N="12" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407C"></COL> mutassent 7.</NOTE>  
secundum malam consuetudinem eorum, nisi
conservarent <NOTE N="13" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407C"></COL> conservassent 7. 9.</NOTE>  in <NOTE N="14" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407D"></COL> in  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1.</NOTE>  omnibus christianitatem, vel
fidelitatem supradicti <NOTE N="15" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407D"></COL> supradicti  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1.</NOTE>  domni Caroli regis et filiorum
eius vel Francorum. Et <NOTE N="16" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407D"></COL> et rex 1. celebravit
rex 7.</NOTE>  celebravit natalem
Domini in villa quae dicitur Dotciacum <NOTE N="17" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407D"></COL> doriacum 1. dorciacum 7. dociacum
9.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="a" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Douzy</HI>  in pago Mosomagensi, prope  <HI REND="ITALIC">Sedan.</HI>  Cf.
Vales. l. c. p. 182, 183.</NOTE> , et pascha
in Aquitania <NOTE N="18" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407D"></COL> equitania 6.</NOTE> , et <NOTE N="19" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407D"></COL> et  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1. 5. 6. 7.
etc.</NOTE>  in villa <NOTE N="20" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407D"></COL> et uilla in 1.</NOTE>  Cassinogilo <NOTE N="21" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407D"></COL> villa quae dicitur cassiuogila
1.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="b" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0408" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0408D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Casseneuil</HI>  in pago Aginnensi. Ibid. p. 131.</NOTE> ;
 <COL N="0407B"></COL> et inmutavit se numerus annorum in</P></DIV2> <DIV2 COM="0407" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0407">DCCLXXVIII.</HEAD> <P COM="0407">Tunc <NOTE N="22" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Hic incipit codex</HI>  3.</NOTE>  domnus Carolus rex <NOTE N="*" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407C"></COL> [motus precibus et querelis christanorum, qui
erant in Hispanic sub iugo Sarracenorum, cum exercitu
Hispaniam intravit 9 b.]</NOTE>  iter peragens <NOTE N="23" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407D"></COL> agens 6.</NOTE>  partibus <NOTE N="24" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407D"></COL> in
partes 1.</NOTE>  
Hispaniae <NOTE N="25" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407D"></COL> partibus italiae 5.</NOTE>  per duas vias; una <NOTE N="26" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407D"></COL> unam 7.</NOTE>  per Pampilonam <NOTE N="27" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407D"></COL> pampilonem
1. 6.</NOTE> ,
per quam ipse supradictus magnus rex
perrexit usque Caesaraugustam; ibique venientes
de partibus Burgundiae et Austriae <NOTE N="28" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407D"></COL> austrasiae 9.</NOTE> , vel Baioariae,
seu Provinciae <NOTE N="29" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407D"></COL> provintiae 5.</NOTE>  et Septimaniae <NOTE N="30" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407D"></COL> septimanaae 1.</NOTE> , et pars Langobardorum <NOTE N="**" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407C"></COL> [His innumerabilibus legionibus Hispania tota
contremuit 9 b.]</NOTE> ,
et coniungentes <NOTE N="31" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407D"></COL> langobardorum coniungentes 7.</NOTE>  se ad supradictam
civitatem ex <NOTE N="32" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407D"></COL> et ex 7.</NOTE>  utraque <NOTE N="33" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407D"></COL> unaque 1.</NOTE>  parte exercitus, ibi obsides
receptos de Ibinalarabi et de Abutauro <NOTE N="34" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407D"></COL> receptos Derbanalambi
et Drabatauro 1.</NOTE>  et de
multis Sarracenis, Pampilona <NOTE N="35" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407D"></COL> pampilonea 2. destructa 1. 5.
6. 7. 8. 9. etc.</NOTE>  distructa, Hispani <NOTE N="36" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407D"></COL> hispanis wasconibus subiugatis . . . 
nabarris 1.</NOTE>  
Wascones <NOTE N="37" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407D"></COL> hispanos et wascones 7. 9.</NOTE>  subiugatos, etiam et Nabarros <NOTE N="38" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407D"></COL> navarros
7.</NOTE> ,
reversus <NOTE N="39" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407D"></COL> Reversus . . . . et cum 2. reversus est 1.
7.</NOTE>  in partibus <NOTE N="40" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407D"></COL> in partes 1.</NOTE>  Franciae. Et cum audissent
Saxones, quod domnus Carolus rex et Franci
 <COL N="0407C"></COL> tam longe fuissent <NOTE N="41" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407D"></COL> essent in p. 6.</NOTE>  partibus Hispaniae, per suasionem <NOTE N="1" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0410" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0410C"></COL> suassionem 2.</NOTE>  
 <COL N="0410A"></COL> supradicti Widokindi <NOTE N="2" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0410" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0410C"></COL> vindekindi 1. widokindi  <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI>  
widokingi 2. widokingi 3. widukindi 4. widochindi 5.
widichindi 6. withochindi 7. widechinni 9. widochindi
10. 11. widikindi 12.</NOTE>  vel <NOTE N="3" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0410" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0410C"></COL> w. et sociorum 1. 7. etc.</NOTE>  sociorum eius
secundum consuetudinem malam iterum rebellati
sunt <NOTE N="4" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0410" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0410C"></COL> rebellaverunt
5.</NOTE> , et nuntiatum est hoc <NOTE N="5" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0410" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0410C"></COL> hoc  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5.</NOTE>  domno rege <NOTE N="6" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0410" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0410C"></COL> regi 1. 5. 6. 7.</NOTE>  Carolo
ad Autosiodorum <NOTE N="7" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0410" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0410C"></COL> annosiodorum 1. authisiodorum 5. autisiodorum
6. 7. etc.</NOTE>  civitatem. Tunc praedictus domnus
rex mittens scaram <NOTE N="8" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0410" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0410C"></COL> scaram francorum velociter et festinanter
ad resistendum supradictis saxonibus ad 1.</NOTE>  Franciscam, ut sub velocitate
festinaret ad resistendos supradictos Saxones <NOTE N="9" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0410" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0410C"></COL> francorum ut sub festinatione curreret ad resistendum
saxonibus, sed illi rebelles pervenerunt usque
diuciam 6.</NOTE> : sed
illi rebelles ad Renum usque Diviciam <NOTE N="10" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0410" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0410C"></COL> diucam 1. diuiciam 2. 3. diutiam  <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI>  
dutiam 5. diuciam 6. dureciam 7. duitiam 8. duitium
9.</NOTE>  pervenerunt,
tunc praedantes secus Renum <NOTE N="11" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0410" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0410C"></COL> renum  <HI REND="ITALIC">constanter in codicibus quos ipse
inspexi</HI>  2. 5. 6.</NOTE> , et multas
malitias facientes, ecclesias Dei incendentes in sanctemonialibus <NOTE N="12" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0410" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0410C"></COL> sanctimonialibus grassati (et)
quod 1. 7. cum sanctimonialibus 9.</NOTE> ,
et quod fastidium generat enumerandi <NOTE N="13" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0410" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0410C"></COL> numerandi
 <COL N="0410D"></COL> 6.</NOTE> .
Et cum <NOTE N="14" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0410" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0410D"></COL> Tum subito 7.</NOTE>  subito audientes de reversione
domni Caroli regis, et de scara eius quam misit obviam <NOTE N="15" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0410" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0410D"></COL> eius. Misit obviam 2.</NOTE>  
illis, tunc a Saxonibus dimisso Reno, reversi
sunt per Logenehi <NOTE N="16" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0410" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0410D"></COL>  
longenhri 1. loinahi 5. loginahi 6. longenehi 7. longene
8. 11. lingonem 9. logene 10.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="e" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0410" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0410D"></COL> Pagus ad Loganam,  <HI REND="ITALIC">Lahngau.</HI></NOTE>  partibus <NOTE N="17" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0410" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0410D"></COL> partes 1.</NOTE>  Saxoniae, et scarae <NOTE N="18" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0410" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0410D"></COL>  
scara 2.</NOTE>  
 <COL N="0410B"></COL> Francorum non <NOTE N="19" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0410" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0410D"></COL> non  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  9.</NOTE>  occurrerunt obviam eis, sed
vestigium eorum <NOTE N="20" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0410" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0410D"></COL> ipsorum 1.</NOTE>  observantes, consecuti sunt eos
super fluvium, cuius vocabulum est Adarna <NOTE N="21" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0410" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0410D"></COL> adarnia
7.</NOTE> , in
loco qui dicitur Lihesi <NOTE N="22" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0410" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0410D"></COL> liesi 5. liesu 6.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="f" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0410" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0410D"></COL> Poeta Saxo ad hunc annum Battenfeld vocat.</NOTE> . Ibi pugna <NOTE N="23" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0410" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0410D"></COL> L. in pugna 2.</NOTE>  incepta et
valde <NOTE N="24" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0410" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0410D"></COL> valde
 <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  6.</NOTE>  bene finita, auxiliante Domino Franci victores
extiterunt; et multitudo Saxonum ibi occisi <NOTE N="25" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0410" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0410D"></COL> occisa et reliqui 1.</NOTE>  
sunt, et fugientes <NOTE N="26" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0410" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0410D"></COL> et reliqui 7.</NOTE>  cum magno contumelio <NOTE N="27" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0410" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0410D"></COL>  
contumelia magna 5. magna contumelia 1. 6.</NOTE>  reversi
sunt Saxoniam 
 <NOTE N="28" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0410" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0410D"></COL> in
saxoniam reversi sunt 1.</NOTE> . Et caelebravit supradictus <NOTE N="29" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0410" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0410D"></COL> supradictus  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  
7.</NOTE>  
clementissimus rex natalem Domini in villa
quae dicitur <NOTE N="30" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0410" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0410D"></COL> villa quae dicitur  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  6.</NOTE>  Haristallio <NOTE N="31" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0410" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0410D"></COL> haristalhio 1.</NOTE> , et pascha similiter.
Et inmutavit se numerus annorum in</P></DIV2> <DIV2 COM="0410" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0410">DCCLXXIX.</HEAD> <P COM="0410">Tunc domnus Carolus rex iter peragens partibus
Niustriae <NOTE N="32" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0410" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0410D"></COL> neustriae 7. niustriae  <HI REND="ITALIC">corr.</HI>  austriae 6.</NOTE> , et <NOTE N="33" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0410" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0410D"></COL> et  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  
6. 7.</NOTE>  pervenit <NOTE N="34" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0410" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0410D"></COL> pervenerunt in 1.</NOTE>  usque in villa <NOTE N="35" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0410" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0410D"></COL> villam 5. 6.</NOTE>  quae
 <COL N="0410C"></COL> dicitur Conpendio <NOTE N="36" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0410" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0410D"></COL> compendium
1.</NOTE> ; et tunc iterum revertendo
partibus <NOTE N="37" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0410" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0410D"></COL> per partes 1.</NOTE>  Austriae, obtulit se Hildebrandus <NOTE N="38" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0410" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0410D"></COL> hiltibrandus 6.</NOTE>  dux
 <COL N="0411A"></COL> Spolitmus <NOTE N="1" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411C"></COL> spoletanus 1. spolitanus 6. 7. 9.</NOTE>  cum multa munera <NOTE N="2" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411C"></COL> multis muneribus
1. 5. 6. 7. etc.</NOTE>  in praesenciam <NOTE N="3" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411C"></COL> praesentia 1. 5. 6. 7. etc.</NOTE>  
supradicti magni regis, in villa qui <NOTE N="4" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411C"></COL> quae 1. 5. 6. 7. etc.</NOTE>  vocatur Virciniacum <NOTE N="5" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411C"></COL> wirciniacum 1. 5. 7. etc.
irciniacum 6.</NOTE> ,
et fuit sinodus in villa nuncupantem <NOTE N="6" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411C"></COL> villa quae dicitur 1. nuncupante
5. 7. nuncupata 6.</NOTE>  
Duria, et iter actus est <NOTE N="7" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411C"></COL> peregit 1. 6. peractum est 6.
peractus est 7.</NOTE>  in <NOTE N="8" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411C"></COL> in  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1. 5. 6. 7. etc.</NOTE>  partibus Saxoniae.
Ad Lippeham <NOTE N="9" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411C"></COL> lippeam
5. lippaham 7.</NOTE>  transitur <NOTE N="10" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411C"></COL> transito rheno flumine 1.</NOTE>  Renus fluvius <NOTE N="11" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411C"></COL> transitu 2. transitus 5. tr. r. fl.  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  6.</NOTE> , et
Saxones voluerunt resistere in loco qui <NOTE N="12" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411C"></COL> que 2.</NOTE>  dicitur
Bohholt <NOTE N="13" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411C"></COL> buoholz 1. bobholz 5. bohholtz 6. bohholz 8. hocholz
9. bolhoz 10. botolz 11.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="a" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Bocholt,</HI>  ad fluvium Aa, a septentrione loci Lippeham.</NOTE> . Auxiliante Domino, non praevaluerunt,
sed abinde fugientes, reliquerunt omnes firmitates
eorum, et Francis aperta est via, et introeuntes in
Westfalaos <NOTE N="14" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411C"></COL> westualahos 1.
westfaluos 2. westualos 6.</NOTE> , et <NOTE N="15" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411C"></COL> et  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5. 7.</NOTE>  conquesierunt <NOTE N="16" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411C"></COL> conquisierunt
1. 5. 7. etc.</NOTE>  eos omnes. Reliqui <NOTE N="17" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411C"></COL> reliquis 7.</NOTE>  
qui ultra Wisora <NOTE N="18" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411C"></COL> wisora
 <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  2. wisoram 6. 7. etc.</NOTE>  fuerunt <NOTE N="19" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411C"></COL> reliqui quidem wisore
 <COL N="0411D"></COL> fuerunt 1.</NOTE> , cum se iunxisset
domnus Carolus rex ad locum qui dicitur Medofulli <NOTE N="20" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411D"></COL> medofuldi 1.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="b" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411D"></COL> In toto Wiserae cursu nonnisi  <HI REND="ITALIC">Mul-beke</HI>  prope
Rinteln et Polle, regni Hannoverani castrum, aliquam
vocis Medofulii similitudinem referunt.</NOTE> ,
ibi dederunt obsides, et denuo <NOTE N="21" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411D"></COL> et dein 1. et deinde
5. 6. denuo  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest.</HI>  7.</NOTE>  sacramenta
firmantes; et tunc <NOTE N="22" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411D"></COL> f. denuo reversus 7.</NOTE>  reversus est suprascriptus
 <COL N="0411B"></COL> gloriosus rex in Francia <NOTE N="23" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411D"></COL> franciam 1. 7. etc. frantiam 6.</NOTE> . Et celebravit natalem
Domini in Wormatiam civitatem <NOTE N="24" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411D"></COL> wormatia civitate
1. 6. 7. etc.</NOTE> , et pascha
similiter. Et inmutavit se numerus annorum in</P></DIV2> <DIV2 COM="0411" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0411">DCCLXXX.</HEAD> <P COM="0411">Tunc domnus Carolus rex iter peragens ad disponendam
Saxoniam, ad Aeresburgum pervenit, et
inde ad locum ubi Lippia consurgit, ibique sinodum
tenens, inde iter peragens partibus Albiae flavii, et
in ipso itinere omnes Bardongauenses <NOTE N="25" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411D"></COL> bardoganenses 1. bardogavenses
7.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="c" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411D"></COL> Pagi Bardengo incolae, qui magnam ducatus Lunebargensis
partem complectebatur; vicus ejus principalis
tum Bardenwich erat.</NOTE>  et multi
de Nordleudi <NOTE N="26" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411D"></COL> nordilendis 1. nortleudi 5. nortelendi 6.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="d" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0412" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0412D"></COL> Id est Saxones transalbiani, Nordalbingi.</NOTE>  baptizati sunt in loco qui dicitur
Orhaim <NOTE N="27" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411D"></COL> orcheim 1. orthaim 5. orahim 7.</NOTE> , ultra Obacro fluvio. Et pervenit usque
ad supradictum fluvium, ubi Ora <NOTE N="28" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411D"></COL> ubi obacrum
fluit 7.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="e" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0412" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0412D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Die Ohre:</HI>  non procul ab ejus cum Albia con
fluentibus hodie oppidum Wolmirstadt situm est.</NOTE>  confluit in Albia <NOTE N="29" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411D"></COL> albiam 1.</NOTE> ,
ibi omniaque <NOTE N="30" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411D"></COL> ibique omnia 7. ibi omnia 1.</NOTE>  disponens <NOTE N="31" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411D"></COL> desponens 2.</NOTE>  tam Saxoniam
quam et Sclavos <NOTE N="32" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411D"></COL> tam sclavoniam quam saxoniam
1.</NOTE> , et <NOTE N="33" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411D"></COL> et  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1. 5. 6. 7. etc.</NOTE>  reversus est supradictus
praeclarus rex in Francia <NOTE N="34" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411D"></COL> franciam 1. 5. 6. 7.</NOTE> . Tunc sumpto consilio,
 <COL N="0411C"></COL> ut iter peragens <NOTE N="35" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411D"></COL> perageret 1. 5. 7. ageret 6.</NOTE>  orationis causae <NOTE N="36" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411D"></COL> causa 1. 5. 6. etc.</NOTE>  partibus Romae,
una cum uxore sua domna Hildegarde <NOTE N="37" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411D"></COL> Hildegarda 6.</NOTE>  regina. Et
celebravit natalem Domini in Papiam civitatem <NOTE N="38" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411D"></COL> papia civitate 1. 6.</NOTE> .
Et immutavit se numerus annorum in</P></DIV2> <COL N="0414A"></COL> <DIV2 COM="0414" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0414">DCCLXXXI.</HEAD> <P COM="0414">Et supradictum iter peragens <NOTE N="1" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0414" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0414C"></COL> Et rex carolus s. i. p. 1. 7.</NOTE> , celebravit pascha
in Roma. Et ibi baptizatus est <NOTE N="2" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0414" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0414C"></COL> est  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  2.</NOTE>  domnus Pippinus,
filius supradicti <NOTE N="3" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0414" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0414C"></COL> supradicti
1. 5. 6. 7. etc.</NOTE>  domni Caroli magni regis, ab
Adriano papa, qui et ipse eum <NOTE N="4" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0414" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0414C"></COL> eum  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  2.</NOTE>  de sacro fonte suscepit,
et duo filii supratitulati domni Caroli regis inuncti <NOTE N="5" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0414" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0414C"></COL> uncti 1.</NOTE>  
sunt ad regem <NOTE N="6" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0414" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0414D"></COL> in regem 5. in reges 1. 7.</NOTE>  a supradicto pontifice; hii
sunt domnus Pippinus et domnus Hludowicus <NOTE N="7" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0414" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0414D"></COL> hlodowicus 6. lodouicus
1.</NOTE>  reges;
domnus Pippinus rex <NOTE N="8" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0414" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0414D"></COL> rex  <HI REND="ITALIC">usque</HI>  rex  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1.</NOTE>  in Italiam, et domnus
Hludowicus rex in Aquitaniam <NOTE N="9" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0414" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0414D"></COL> hludow. in aquit. 2.
hlodowicus rex in equitania 7.</NOTE> . Et inde revertente
domno Carolo rege, Mediolanis civitate <NOTE N="10" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0414" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0414D"></COL> mediolanum civitatem
1.</NOTE>  pervenit,
et ibi baptizata est filia eius domna Gisola <NOTE N="11" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0414" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0414D"></COL> gistola 1. gisola 7.</NOTE>  ab archiepiscopo
nomine Thoma <NOTE N="12" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0414" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0414D"></COL> dioma 1.</NOTE> , qui et ipse eam a sacro
baptismate <NOTE N="13" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0414" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0414D"></COL> sacro
fonte 6. 7. baptismo 1. 5.</NOTE>  manibus suscepit <NOTE N="14" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0414" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0414D"></COL> fonte levavit 6.</NOTE> . Et ab inde reversus
 <COL N="0414B"></COL> est in Franciam. Et tunc missi sunt duo
missi <NOTE N="15" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0414" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0414D"></COL> missi duo 1.</NOTE>  ab apostolico supradicto <NOTE N="16" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0414" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0414D"></COL> supradicto scilicet f. 1.</NOTE> , hii sunt Formonsus <NOTE N="17" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0414" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0414D"></COL> formosus
5.</NOTE>  
et Damasus <NOTE N="18" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0414" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0414D"></COL> damansus 1.</NOTE>  episcopi, ad Tassilonem <NOTE N="19" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0414" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0414D"></COL> thassilonem 1. tessilonem
6.</NOTE>  
ducem una cum missis domni Caroli regis <NOTE N="20" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0414" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0414D"></COL> regis scilicet richolfus diaconus et eberhartus
munere pincernario 1.</NOTE> , his nominibus,
Riculfum <NOTE N="21" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0414" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0414D"></COL> ruculfum 6.</NOTE>  diaconem et Eborhardum <NOTE N="22" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0414" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0414D"></COL> eberaldum
7.</NOTE>  
magister <NOTE N="23" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0414" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0414D"></COL> magistrum 5. 6. 7.</NOTE>  pincernarum, ad commonendum et contestandum,
ut reminisceret <NOTE N="24" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0414" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0414D"></COL> reminisceretur
5.</NOTE>  priscorum sacramentorum
suorum, ut <NOTE N="25" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0414" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0414D"></COL> et ut non 1. 5. 6. 7. etc.</NOTE>  non aliter faceret, nisi sicut <NOTE N="26" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0414" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0414D"></COL> nisi ut 1. 6.</NOTE>  
iureiurando iam dudum promiserat ad partem <NOTE N="27" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0414" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0414D"></COL> ad
partem  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  5.</NOTE>  
domni Pippini regis et <NOTE N="28" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0414" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0414D"></COL> domni pippini regis et  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  6.</NOTE>  domni Caroli magni regis
vel <NOTE N="29" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0414" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0414D"></COL> vel  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1.</NOTE>  Francorum. Et tunc consensit Tassilo <NOTE N="30" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0414" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0414D"></COL> tesilo 6.</NOTE>  dux
Baioariorum, ut sumptos obsides a domno rege Carolo,
et tunc <NOTE N="31" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0414" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0414D"></COL> carolo tunc 7.</NOTE>  veniret <NOTE N="32" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0414" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0414D"></COL> veniet
2. veniret  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  6.</NOTE>  ad eius praesenciam; quod
et domnus praefatus rex non rennuit <NOTE N="33" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0414" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0414D"></COL> renuit 1. 7.</NOTE> . Et coniungens
se supradictus dux in praesenciam piissimi regis
 <COL N="0414C"></COL> ad Wormaciam <NOTE N="34" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0414" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0414D"></COL> vurmatiam
5. vurmaticam 6. warmaciam 7.</NOTE>  civitatem, ibi renovans sacramenta,
et dans duodecim obsides electos, ut omnia
conservaret <NOTE N="35" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0414" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0414D"></COL> conservare
1. conseruarent 2.</NOTE> , quicquid domno Pippino regi <NOTE N="36" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0414" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0414D"></COL> domnus pippinus rex 2.</NOTE>  promiserat
iureiurando, in causa supradicti domni Caroli
regis vel fidelium suorum; qui et ipsi obsides
recepti sunt in Carisiacum villa <NOTE N="37" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0414" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0414D"></COL> carisiaca uilla 1.</NOTE>  de manu Sinberti <NOTE N="38" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0414" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0414D"></COL> simberti 1. sinberti 2. 3. 5.
6. ingberti 7.</NOTE>  
episcopi. Sed non diu praefatus dux Tassilo
promissiones quas fecerat conservavit. Et celebravit
praedictus domnus gloriosus rex natalem Domini in
supradictam villam <NOTE N="39" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0414" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0414D"></COL> villam  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  2.</NOTE>  Carisiacum <NOTE N="40" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0414" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0414D"></COL> supradicta civitate
carisiaca 1.</NOTE> , et pascha similiter.
Et inmutavit se numerus annorum in</P></DIV2> <COL N="0415A"></COL> <DIV2 COM="0415" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0415">DCCLXXXII.</HEAD> <P COM="0415">Tunc domnus Carolus rex iter peragens, Renum
transiens <NOTE N="1" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0415" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0415C"></COL> pertransiens 6.</NOTE>  ad Coloniam, et synodum <NOTE N="2" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0415" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0415C"></COL> coloniam synodum 7.</NOTE>  tenuit ubi
Lippia consurgit. Ibique omnes Saxones venientes <NOTE N="3" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0415" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0415C"></COL> venerunt
e. rebelle vindikinde 1.</NOTE> ,
excepto rebellis Widochindus <NOTE N="4" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0415" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0415C"></COL> rebelle uuidochindo
5. windochindus 7.</NOTE> , etiam illuc convenerunt <NOTE N="5" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0415" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0415C"></COL> venerunt postlimani
1.</NOTE>  
Nordmanni <NOTE N="6" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0415" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0415C"></COL> nortmani 5. northmanni 6.</NOTE>  missi Sigifridi <NOTE N="7" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0415" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0415C"></COL> sifridi 1. sigifredi
5. 7. godefridi 7b. 9b.</NOTE>  regis <NOTE N="8" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0415" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0415C"></COL> regis, halbdani
 <COL N="0415D"></COL> cum sociis suis similiter. et 1.</NOTE> : id
est Halptani <NOTE N="9" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0415" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0415D"></COL> haltani 5.
haltoni 7. halptani 2. 3. 6.</NOTE>  cum sociis suis. Similiter et Avari
illuc convenerunt, missi a Cagano et Iugurro. <NOTE N="10" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0415" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0415D"></COL> vigerio 1. vigurro 7.
iugurno 5.</NOTE>  Ibi
peracto placito, reversus est domnus Carolus rex in
Franciam. Et cum reversus fuisset, statim iterum
Saxones solito more rebellati sunt, suadente Widochindo. <NOTE N="11" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0415" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0415D"></COL> vindekindo 1, widichindo 2.</NOTE>  
Et ignorante hoc domno Carolo rege,
misit missos suos Adalghisum <NOTE N="12" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0415" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0415D"></COL> adalgisum
1. 5. 6. 7.</NOTE>  et Gailonem <NOTE N="13" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0415" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0415D"></COL> algonem 1. galonem 5. gaiolonem
6. wailonem 7.</NOTE>  atque
Woradum, ut moverent exercitum Francorum et
 <COL N="0415B"></COL> Saxonum super Sclavos paucos, qui rebelles fuerant <NOTE N="14" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0415" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0415D"></COL> fuerunt 1.</NOTE> .
Et supranominati missi in via audientes, quod Saxones
rebellati fuissent <NOTE N="15" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0415" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0415D"></COL> rebellassent
1. 5.</NOTE> , coniungentes supradictam
scaram, inruerunt super Saxones <NOTE N="16" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0415" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0415D"></COL> irruerunt in s. 1.</NOTE> , et nullum mandatum
exinde fecerunt domno Carolo rege <NOTE N="17" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0415" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0415D"></COL> regi 1. 5. 6. 7.
etc.</NOTE> . Et
commiserunt bellum cum Saxonibus, et fortiter pugnantes,
et multos Saxones interementes <NOTE N="18" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0415" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0415D"></COL> interimentes 1. 5. 6. 7.</NOTE> , victores
extiterunt <NOTE N="19" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0415" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0415D"></COL> extitere 1.</NOTE>  Franci. Et ceciderunt ibi duo ex
ipsis missis, Adalgisus et Gailo, in monte qui dicitur
Sundal <NOTE N="20" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0415" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0415D"></COL> suntal 1. sumptdal 5. siimptal 6. suntdal 7.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="a" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0415" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0415D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Der Sündel, Süntel,</HI>  in septentrionali Wiserae
ripa, inter Münderam et Rintelam, in cujus latere
septentrionali  <HI REND="ITALIC">das Dachtelfeld,</HI>  id est campus in quo
quis vapulavit.</NOTE> . Hoc audiensque <NOTE N="21" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0415" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0415D"></COL> audiens quod 2. audiens  <HI REND="ITALIC">reliqui.</HI></NOTE>  domnus Carolus
rex, una cum Francis quos sub celeritate coniungere
potuit, illuc perrexit, et pervenit usque ad locum
ubi Alara <NOTE N="22" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0415" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0415D"></COL> alacra 6.</NOTE>  confluit in Wisora. Tunc omnes Saxones
iterum convenientes, subdiderunt se sub
potestate supradicti domno rege <NOTE N="23" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0415" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0415D"></COL> domni regis 1. 5. 6. 7. etc.</NOTE> , et reddiderunt
 <COL N="0415C"></COL> omnes malefactores <NOTE N="24" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0415" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0415D"></COL> malefactores
illos rebelles et occiderunt excepto vindikindo 1.</NOTE>  illos, qui ipsud <NOTE N="25" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0415" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0415D"></COL> ipsum 1. 5. 6. 7. etc.</NOTE>  rebellium
maxime terminaverunt, ad occidendum, quatuor
milia quingentos; quod ita et factum est, excepto
Widochindum <NOTE N="26" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0415" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0415D"></COL> widochindo 5. 6. 7.
etc.</NOTE> , qui fuga lapsus <NOTE N="27" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0415" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0415D"></COL> elapsus 1. 7.</NOTE>  est <NOTE N="28" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0415" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0415D"></COL> exc. W. q. f. l. est  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest.</HI>  
6.</NOTE>  partibus <NOTE N="29" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0415" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0415D"></COL> ad partes 1.</NOTE>  
Nordmanniae <NOTE N="30" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0415" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0415D"></COL> normanniae 7.</NOTE> . Haec omnia peracta <NOTE N="31" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0415" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0415D"></COL> iis peractis
1.</NOTE> , reversus est
praefatus domnus rex in Francia. Et celebravit natalem
Domini in villa quae dicitur Teodone-villa <NOTE N="32" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0415" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0415D"></COL> theodonis 1. theodone 7.</NOTE>  et
pascha similiter. Et inmutavit se numerus annorum in</P></DIV2> <COL N="0418C"></COL> <DIV2 COM="0418" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0418">DCCLXXXIII.</HEAD> <P COM="0418">Tunc obiit domna ac bene merita Hildegardis regina
pridie Kal. Mai. <NOTE N="1" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0418" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0418D"></COL> maii quae erat vigilia 1.</NOTE> , quod evenit in die tunc in
tempore vigilia <NOTE N="b" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0417" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0417D"></COL> Recte, quia pascha in diem 23 Martii cecidit.</NOTE>  ascensionis Domini. <NOTE N="*" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0419" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0419B"></COL> [et sepulta est iuxta urbem Mettensem in basilica
apostolorum et beati Arnulfi. 9 b.]</NOTE>  Et domnus
rex Carolus iter fecit partibus <NOTE N="2" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0418" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0418D"></COL> per partes  <HI REND="ITALIC">ita constanter,
ex coniectura ni fallor Canisii</HI>  1.</NOTE>  Saxoniae, eo quod
 <COL N="0418D"></COL> Saxones iterum rebelles fuissent <NOTE N="3" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0418" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0418D"></COL> rebellarent
1.</NOTE> , et cum paucis
Francis ad Theotmalli <NOTE N="4" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0418" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0418D"></COL> theotwaldi 1. theodmali 6. theotmallim
7. theodmalli 9.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="c" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0418" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0418D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Detmold.</HI></NOTE>  pervenit. Ibi Saxones
praeparaverunt pugna <NOTE N="5" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0418" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0418D"></COL> pugnam 1. 5. 6. 7.</NOTE>  in campo, qui <NOTE N="6" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0418" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0418D"></COL> quo 7.
 <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1.</NOTE>  viriliter
domnus Carolus rex et Franci solito more super eos
inruentes [et Saxones terga vertentes <NOTE N="7" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0418" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0418D"></COL> et saxones terga vertentes  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  2.</NOTE>  ], et Domino <NOTE N="8" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0418" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0418D"></COL> vertentes domino 7.</NOTE>  
 <COL N="0419A"></COL> auxiliante, Franci victores extiterunt. Et cecidit ibi <NOTE N="1" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0419" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0419C"></COL> ibi  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  2.</NOTE>  
maxima <NOTE N="2" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0419" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0419C"></COL> maxime 2.</NOTE>  multitudo Saxonum, ita ut pauci fugam <NOTE N="3" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0419" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0419C"></COL> fuga 5. 7.</NOTE>  
evasissent. Et inde cum victoria venit suprascriptus
gloriosus rex ad Paderbrunnen <NOTE N="4" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0419" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0419C"></COL> padenbrun
 <COL N="0419D"></COL> 1.</NOTE> , ibi coniungens
exercitum suum. Et perrexit ubi iterum <NOTE N="5" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0419" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0419D"></COL> iterum  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1.</NOTE>  Saxones se
coniunxerunt ad fluvium cuius vocabulum est Hasa. <NOTE N="a" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0419" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0419D"></COL> In cujus ripa Osnabrück.</NOTE>  
Ibi <NOTE N="6" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0419" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0419D"></COL> ibi  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1. 7.</NOTE>  iterum pugna inita, non minor numerus Saxonum
ibi cecidit, et Domino auxiliante Franci victores extiterunt.
Et iter peragens iam dictus domnus <NOTE N="7" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0419" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0419D"></COL> domnus rex 1. 7.</NOTE> , Wisoram
fluvium transiit, ad Albiam <NOTE N="8" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0419" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0419D"></COL> albium 5.</NOTE>  fluvium usque
pervenit; et inde reversus praefatus magnus rex in
Franciam. Et in eodem anno obiit bonae memoriae
domna Berta regina 4 Idus Iul. <NOTE N="**" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0419" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0419B"></COL> [et sepulta est in Causiaco. Sed inde translata
Parisius, sepulta est iuxta virum suum in ecclesia
sancti Dionysii martyris. 9 b.]</NOTE>  Et cum Wormaciam <NOTE N="9" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0419" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0419D"></COL> uurmaciam
5. warmaciam 7.</NOTE>  
pervenisset domnus rex Carolus, sociavit
 <COL N="0419B"></COL> sibi in matrimonium <NOTE N="10" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0419" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0419D"></COL> sibi matrim. 5.</NOTE>  domna Fastradane regina <NOTE N="11" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0419" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0419D"></COL> dominam
Fastradam reginam 1. domnam fastradanem reginam
7.</NOTE> .
Et celebravit natalem Domini in villa quae dicitur
Haristallio <NOTE N="12" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0419" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0419D"></COL> haristalho 1.</NOTE> , et pascha similiter. Et inmutavit se
numerus annorum in</P></DIV2> <COL N="0419C"></COL> <DIV2 COM="0419" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0419">DCCLXXXIV.</HEAD> <P COM="0419">Et tunc <NOTE N="13" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0419" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0419D"></COL> Saxones tunc iterum
rebellarunt 1.</NOTE>  rebellati sunt <NOTE N="14" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0419" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0419D"></COL> rebellaverunt 5.</NOTE>  iterum Saxones solito
more, et cum eis pars <NOTE N="15" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0419" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0419D"></COL> par 2.</NOTE>  aliqua Frisonum. <NOTE N="16" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0419" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0419D"></COL> fresonum
5. forisonum 6.</NOTE>  Tunc
deinde domnus Carolus rex iter peragens, Renum
transiit ad Lippiham <NOTE N="17" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0419" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0419D"></COL> lippiam 1. 2. 7. lippiaham
5. lippiham 6.</NOTE> , et ingressus est Saxoniam
circuiendo <NOTE N="18" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0419" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0419D"></COL> circuendo 1.</NOTE>  et vastando, usque quod <NOTE N="19" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0419" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0419D"></COL> quod
 <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1. 6. usque quo 7.</NOTE>  pervenit <NOTE N="20" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0419" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0419D"></COL> pervenit  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1.</NOTE>  
ad Huculvi <NOTE N="21" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0419" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0419D"></COL> huculum
1. huculin. 7. hucului 2. 3. 5. 6. 8. 9.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="b" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0419" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0419D"></COL> Oppidum  <HI REND="ITALIC">Petershagen,</HI>  olim  <HI REND="ITALIC"> Hockeleve,</HI>  nomen hodiernum una cum jure civitatis sortitum.</NOTE> . Ibi consilio inito, eo, <NOTE N="22" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0419" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0419D"></COL> eo
 <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  6.</NOTE>  quod nimium
inundaciones aquarum fuissent <NOTE N="23" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0419" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0419D"></COL> quod minime essent i. a. 1.</NOTE> , ut per Toringiam <NOTE N="24" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0419" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0419D"></COL> thuringiam
1. durringiam 6. thoringiam 7.</NOTE>  
de orientale parte introisset super Ostfalaos <NOTE N="25" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0419" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0419D"></COL> hostfalaos 5.
ostualaos 1.</NOTE> ,
et filium suum domnum Carolum dimisisset
una cum scara contra Westfalaos <NOTE N="26" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0419" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0419D"></COL> westualos 1. wetfalaos 5.</NOTE> : quod et ita <NOTE N="27" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0419" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0419D"></COL> quod
ita 1. 2. 7. et quod ita 6.</NOTE>  
factum est. Domnus rex Carolus perrexit per Toringiam <NOTE N="28" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0419" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0419D"></COL> turingiam 1. toringam
2. durringam 6. thoringiam 7.</NOTE>  
usque ad fluvium Albiam, et inde ad Stagnfurd <NOTE N="1" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0422" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0422C"></COL> stainfurt 1. stagnfrud 2 stangfurt 5. stagnfurt 6.
stangfurd 7. stagnfurd 8. stangford 9.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="f" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0421" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0421D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Stasfurt</HI>  ad Budam? Certe locus in vado fluminis cujusdam inter sylvam Hercyniam et Albiam investigandus est,
nec alius tam commodus occurrit, 
 <COL N="0422D"></COL> cum et Pippinus anno, 748 eadem via per Hochseeburg et Stagnfurt ad loca Scahaningi et Orhaim accessisse videatur.</NOTE>  
 <COL N="0422A"></COL> et inde ad Scahiningi <NOTE N="2" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0422" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0422C"></COL> schalingi 1.
scainingi 5. 6. scaingi 7. scaningi 9.</NOTE> , ibique conventionem
factam <NOTE N="3" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0422" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0422C"></COL> conventione
facta 1. 5. 6. 7. etc.</NOTE> , reversus est in Franciam <NOTE N="4" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0422" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0422C"></COL> frantiam 5. 6.</NOTE>  
supradictus gloriosus rex. Westfalai vero voluerunt
se congregare ad Lippiam. <NOTE N="5" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0422" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0422C"></COL> ad philippiam
6.</NOTE>  Quo auditu a <NOTE N="6" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0422" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0422C"></COL> auditu co ( <HI REND="ITALIC">ortum ex forma tunc usitata litterae</HI> )
2. audito a 1. 5. 6. 7. etc.</NOTE>  supradicto
filio domni Caroli regis, obviam eis accessit <NOTE N="7" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0422" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0422C"></COL> Q. a supradictus filius
d. c. r. obviam ivit eis 1. (eis accessit) 7. 9.</NOTE>  
una cum scara quae cum eo dimissa fuit, in pago
qui dicitur Dragini <NOTE N="8" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0422" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0422C"></COL> oragmi
1 dragani 6.</NOTE> , et inierunt bellum. Auxiliante
Domino, domnus Carolus, filius <NOTE N="9" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0422" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0422C"></COL> filium 2.</NOTE>  magni regis
Caroli, victor extitit una cum Francis, multis Saxonibus
interfectis. Volente Deo, inlaesus remeavit ad
genitorem suum in Wormaciam civitatem: ibique <NOTE N="10" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0422" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0422C"></COL> ibi 1.</NOTE>  
initio consilio cum Francis, ut iterum hieme <NOTE N="11" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0422" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0422C"></COL> hiemis 1.
7.</NOTE>  tempore
iter fecisset <NOTE N="12" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0422" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0422C"></COL> faceret 1. 7. inter fecisset 2.</NOTE>  supradictus domnus rex in Saxoniam;
quod ita et factum est. Et celebravit natalem
 <COL N="0422B"></COL> Domini iuxta Skidrioburg <NOTE N="13" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0422" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0422C"></COL> kidrioburg 1.
kydrioburg 6, hidrioburg 9.</NOTE>  in pago Waizzagawi <NOTE N="14" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0422" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0422C"></COL> vuazzaganni 1.
waizzagawi 2. 3. waizzagavi 5. wazzagaiuu 6. wauzanaga
7. waizzgawi 8. waisagawi 9.</NOTE>  
super fluvium Ambra <NOTE N="15" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0422" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0422C"></COL> ambram 1.</NOTE>  in villa Liudihi <NOTE N="16" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0422" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0422C"></COL> lutundi 1. liudihi 2. 3. liuhidi 5. 8. liuthildi 6.
luidi 7. luichidi 9.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="g" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0422" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0422D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Olden-Lüde</HI>  jam desolatum secundum Falkium
p. 349, qui vicum hodie exstantem Lüde prope Pyrmontum
serius constructum fuisse contendit; quod
ita se habere, eo probatur, quod Schieder longius a
Lüde distat, quam ut juxta illud situm fuisse dici
possit.</NOTE> . Et
inmutavit se numerus annorum in</P></DIV2> <DIV2 COM="0422" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0422">DCCLXXXV.</HEAD> <P COM="0422">Tunc domnus Carolus rex <NOTE N="17" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0422" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0422C"></COL> rex carolus 1. 5. 6. 7.</NOTE>  supradictum iter peragens,
usque ad Rimie <NOTE N="18" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0422" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0422C"></COL> rimee
 <COL N="0422D"></COL> 1. 5. 7. rimee 6. rimie 2. 8. 9.</NOTE>  pervenit super fluvium Wisora <NOTE N="19" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0422" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0422D"></COL> wisoraha 1.
wisoram 7.</NOTE> ,ubi confluit Waharma <NOTE N="20" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0422" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0422D"></COL> vinharna 1.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="h" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0422" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0422D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Die Werne.</HI></NOTE> . Et propter nimias <NOTE N="21" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0422" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0422D"></COL> nimiam 1. 2. 6. 7.</NOTE>  
inundationes <NOTE N="22" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0422" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0422D"></COL> inundationem 1. 7.</NOTE>  aquarum inde reversus est
Aeresburgum <NOTE N="23" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0422" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0422D"></COL> eresburgam 6.</NOTE> : uxorem suam domnam Fastradanem <NOTE N="24" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0422" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0422D"></COL> fastradam
1. fastradanam 6.</NOTE>  
reginam una cum filiis et filiabus suis ad se
venire iussit. Ibi tota hieme resedens <NOTE N="25" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0422" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0422D"></COL> residens 1. 5. 6. residens
ibidem 7.</NOTE> , et ibi pascha
iam fatus excellentissimus rex celebravit. Et
dum ibi resideret, multotiens scara <NOTE N="26" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0422" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0422D"></COL> scaras 1. 5. 6. 7. scaram 2.</NOTE>  misit, et per
semetipsum iter peregit <NOTE N="27" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0422" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0422D"></COL> peragit
5.</NOTE> : Saxones, qui rebelles <NOTE N="28" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0422" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0422D"></COL> qui rebelles  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  2.</NOTE>  
 <COL N="0422C"></COL> fuerunt <NOTE N="29" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0422" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0422D"></COL> rebelles erant 1.</NOTE> , depraedavit, et castra coepit, et loca eorum
 <COL N="0423A"></COL> munita intervenit <NOTE N="1" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0423" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0423C"></COL> intravit 1.</NOTE> , et vias mundavit <NOTE N="2" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0423" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0423C"></COL> inundavit 1.</NOTE> , ut <NOTE N="3" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0423" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0423C"></COL> ut  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  7.</NOTE>  
 <NOTE N="4" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0423" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0423C"></COL> sinodum
vero publicam 5. Sinadum vero publicum 6.</NOTE>  dum tempus congruum venisset, sinodum publicum
tenuit ad <NOTE N="5" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0423" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0423C"></COL> celebravit apud 1. 7.</NOTE>  Paderbrunnen. Et inde iter peragens,
vias apertas <NOTE N="6" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0423" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0423C"></COL> apertas, faciens 7.</NOTE> , nemini <NOTE N="7" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0423" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0423C"></COL> nemine
1. 5. 6. 7.</NOTE>  contradicente, per totam
Saxoniam quocumque <NOTE N="8" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0423" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0423C"></COL> quodcumque 7.</NOTE>  voluit. Et <NOTE N="9" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0423" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0423C"></COL> Et  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1.</NOTE>  tunc in Bardengawi <NOTE N="10" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0423" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0423C"></COL> bardunganice 1. bardingawi 5. padangowi 6.</NOTE>  venit, ibique mittens post Widochindum <NOTE N="11" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0423" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0423C"></COL> vindikindem 1. windochindum 7. widichindum 6.</NOTE>  
et Abbionem, et utrosque <NOTE N="12" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0423" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0423C"></COL> abbionem utrosque 2. 7.</NOTE>  ad se conduxit, et
firmavit, ut non se subtrahissent <NOTE N="13" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0423" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0423C"></COL> subtraherent 1. subtraxissent
5. 7.</NOTE> , nisi <NOTE N="14" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0423" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0423C"></COL> s. priusquam in f. 1.</NOTE>  in Franciam <NOTE N="15" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0423" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0423C"></COL> francia
5.6.7.</NOTE>  
ad eum pervenissent: petentibus illis, ut
credentias haberent, quod inlaesi fuissent: sicut et
factum est. <NOTE N="16" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0423" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0423C"></COL> sicut factum 1.</NOTE>  Tunc domnus rex reversus est in Franciam,
et mittens ad supradictum <NOTE N="17" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0423" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0423C"></COL> supradictos 1. 5. 6. 7.</NOTE>  Widochindum <NOTE N="18" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0423" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0423C"></COL> windekindem 1. windochindum 5. 7.</NOTE>  
et Abbionem obsides per missum suum <NOTE N="19" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0423" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0423C"></COL> suum
 <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  6.</NOTE>  Amalwinum <NOTE N="20" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0423" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0423C"></COL> amulwinum 2. amalwionem 7.</NOTE> ;
