 <COL N="0423D"></COL> 1. 5. 6. 7.</NOTE>  obsides illos secum
 <COL N="0423B"></COL> deducentes <NOTE N="22" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0423" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0423D"></COL> ducentes 1. deduxerunt 6.</NOTE> , coniunxerunt <NOTE N="23" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0423" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0423D"></COL>  
