 <HI REND="ITALIC">legendum esse putavit.</HI></NOTE>  
una <NOTE N="30" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0423" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0423D"></COL> una  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1.</NOTE>  cum sociis eorum. Et <NOTE N="31" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0423" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0423D"></COL> Et
 <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  1.</NOTE>  tunc tota Saxonia
subiugata est. Coniuratio <NOTE N="32" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0423" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0423D"></COL> Coniuratio . . . . damnati sunt  <HI REND="ITALIC">deest in omnibus
codicibus exceptis</HI>  5.  <HI REND="ITALIC">et</HI>  6;  <HI REND="ITALIC">legitur in Annal.
Einhardi et Fuldens.</HI></NOTE>  Hardradi et orientalium
