 <COL N="0423C"></COL> una cum castellis et firmitates <NOTE N="40" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0423" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0423D"></COL> firmitatibus 1. 7.</NOTE>  eorum <NOTE N="41" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0423" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0423D"></COL> firm. brittonum
in locis 1.</NOTE>  locis
