prospiciens 6. 7.</NOTE> ,
se ex omne parte Deo largiente pacem habere, 
suscepit <NOTE N="4" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0426" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0426C"></COL> sumpsit 1. 5. 6. 7.</NOTE>  consilium orationis <NOTE N="5" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0426" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0426C"></COL> devotionis
causa 1. 7.</NOTE>  causae <NOTE N="6" TYPE="Variantes Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0426" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0426C"></COL> causa 5.</NOTE>  ad
